---
name: committing
description: How a commit is cut: one concern per commit, the issue it references, files staged by name. Use before any git commit.
metadata:
  body: guidelines
  usage:
    expect: triggered
  force-load-on-tool-calls:
    - 'Bash.command /(^|[;&|]\s*|\n\s*)git\s+commit\b/'
---
